.
.  Anscombe plots
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
pre-erase off
erase
.
set ipl1na ansco4.ps
device 2 postscript
.
skip 25
read anscombe.dat x1 y1 x2 y2 x3 y3 x4 y4
multiplot corner coordinates 2 2 98 98
multiplot 2 2
character hw 6 4.5
character circle BLANK
character fill on
line blank solid
title size 6
tic mark label size 6
loop for k = 1 1 4
  title data set ^k
  fit y^k x^k
  plot y^k x^k and
  plot pred x^k
end of loop
end of multiplot
.
. box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv ANSCO4.PS ansco4.ps
.
. quit
